# Frontend UI Engineering

Full skill: [SKILL.md](mdc:.agents/skills/frontend-ui-engineering/SKILL.md).

- Read existing tokens/components before inventing new visual language.
- Declare colors, type, spacing, radius, elevation, icon style, motion, and
  breakpoints before substantial UI code.
- Build loading, empty, error, focus, disabled, success, and validation states.
- Verify keyboard access, visible focus, contrast, responsive widths, and reduced
  motion.
- Avoid generic AI UI: purple gradients, oversized rounded cards, stock card
  grids, fake content, and emoji icons.
